                  "description_en": "The role of the cluster. Valid values:\n\nprimary: primary cluster\n\nstandby: secondary cluster\n\nA GDN contains one primary cluster and up to four secondary clusters",
                  "description_zh": "集群角色。取值：\n\nprimary：主集群\n\nstandby：从集群\n\n一个GDN中包含一个主集群和最多四个从集群",
                  "example": "primary",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "ServerlessType": {
                  "backendName": "serverlessType",
                  "description_en": "The serverless type. The value is fixed as AgileServerless.\nThis parameter is supported only for serverless clusters",
                  "description_zh": "Serverless类型。当前取值固定为AgileServerless（敏态）。\n仅Serverless集群支持该参数",
